{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-05-11 09:35:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL STAPLES FORUM', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE (NYSE:CL) PRESIDENT, COLGATE-LATIN AMERICA, JUAN PABLO ZAMORANO, AND CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER AND SVP, M&A, JOHN FAUCHER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL STAPLES FORUM ON TUESDAY, MAY 16, 2023 AT 9:35 AM ET. INVESTORS MAY ACCESS A LIVE WEBCAST OF THIS FIRESIDE CHAT ON COLGATE'S WEBSITE AT WWW.COLGATEPALMOLIVE.COM. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE LIVE WEBCAST, A RECORDED VERSION OF THE WEBCAST WIL."}